# Pin the connectivity policy doc + its manifest to LF so their SHA-256 integrity record
# (docs/CONNECTIVITY-POLICY-MANIFEST.json policy_sha256, verified by the Phase 6C/6F tests) is
# stable in every checkout regardless of core.autocrlf. Everything else keeps the default behavior.
docs/CONNECTIVITY-POLICY.md text eol=lf
docs/CONNECTIVITY-POLICY-MANIFEST.json text eol=lf
